I place the hot Kande Pohe dish on the table.
First I serve it on Neha's plate.
Then I serve it on Amit's plate.
"First eat this, after that drink tea," I say to Neha.
Amit eats a little with a spoon.
"Maya, this is very tasty," Amit says.
"There is a perfect Maharashtrian flavor here," Neha says.
She quickly eats everything.
"I cooked half a kilo of poha here," I say.
"Even so, I used only two spoons of oil," I say.
"Do you want more lemon juice here?" I ask Amit.
"No, this is completely perfect," Amit says.
"Please give me more too," Neha says smiling.
I serve her more Kande Pohe.
"After that we will discuss badminton," Amit says.
My friends really like my cooking.
Today our mealtime is very joyful.
